<title>SPAIN: Spain's Dominguez to trade again until 1600 GMT.</title>
<headline>Spain's Dominguez to trade again until 1600 GMT.</headline>
<dateline>MADRID 1997-03-19</dateline>
<text>
<p>Shares in Spanish fashion house Adolfo Dominguez resumed trading until 1600 GMT, bourse authority Sociedad de Bolsas said on Wednesday.</p>
<p>The price was unchanged from this morning at around 5,060 pesetas, at the 15 percent maximum fluctuation limit.</p>
<p>At around 1515 GMT traded volume was 158,765 shares. At this price there were sell orders waiting for almost 1.09 million shares.</p>
<p>Trade was curbed today because of the heavy order floor.</p>
<p>-- Madrid newsroom +341 585 2160</p>
</text>
